                           ! JNC_START_CMP_RSTOP)

CMP_RSTOP_COEFFICIENT(2,1) 1 ! Coefficient: rebound stop deflection per unit jounce
                             ! at wheel (mm/mm), axle 2, left side
CMP_RSTOP_GAIN(2,1) 1 ! Gain multiplied with calculated value to get rebound stop
